       The  same  errors  that  occur for uuttiimmeess(2) can also occur for ffuuttiimmee‐‐
       ssaatt().  The following additional errors can occur for ffuuttiimmeessaatt():

       EEBBAADDFF  _p_a_t_h is relative but _d_i_r_f_d is neither AATT__FFDDCCWWDD nor a valid  file
              descriptor.

       EENNOOTTDDIIRR
              _p_a_t_h  is  relative and _d_i_r_f_d is a file descriptor referring to a
              file other than a directory.

